From: local patch <local@ax3600>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 19:34:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommax: ax3600/ax6: disable USB controller and PHY nodes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AX3600 与 Redmi AX6 均无 USB 口，但 ipq8074-common.dtsi 无条件把
qusb_phy_0/1、ssphy_0/1、usb_0/1 全部 status = "okay"，导致开机时
dwc3-qcom 报 -EBUSY、QUSB2PHY pll lock failed 等噪音，探测不存在的硬件。

ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi 同时被 ipq8071-ax3600.dts 与 ipq8071-ax6.dts
include，故在此集中覆盖，一处改动覆盖四个设备镜像。
---
 .../linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi  | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi b/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi
index 67e79ae..8b8ba50 100644
--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/dts/ipq8071-xiaomi.dtsi
@@ -198,3 +198,28 @@
 &edma {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+/* AX3600 / AX6 均无 USB 口，整套 USB 控制器与 PHY 不参与 probe */
+&qusb_phy_0 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&qusb_phy_1 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&ssphy_0 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&ssphy_1 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&usb_0 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
+&usb_1 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
-- 
2.34.1

